    <summary>On-premise OctoWatch DLP server stack for Windows employee monitoring and endpoint data protection.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
## OctoWatch Server (On-Premise)

Bring **Windows workforce visibility and endpoint DLP** into your own data center. This package installs the official **OctoWatch Server** distribution used for On-Premise deployments: Admin Console, monitoring services, and the Web Console host on customer infrastructure.

### Why teams choose On-Prem OctoWatch

- Keep monitoring and DLP telemetry **inside your network** when Cloud is not an option
- Investigate insider risk with activity evidence, rules hits, and console analytics
- Scale floating licenses by **active tracked users** (console operators are unlimited)
- Pair with Windows Grabbers on workstations and RDS sessions after Server setup

### What this package does

Downloads the signed installer from the official site and runs a silent Inno Setup installation:

`https://octowatchdlp.com/OWServerSetup.exe`

### Important requirements

- **Administrator** rights / machine-wide install
- **Internet** may be required during setup so Windows can pull IIS / DISM features from Microsoft
- **Microsoft SQL Server 2014+** (Express is commonly used) — database is **not** bundled by Chocolatey; configure SQL before or after Server install per the docs
- After Server is ready, deploy Grabbers from the Admin Console / Web Console workflow (Grabber is a separate installer)

### License / trial

Commercial **shareware**. A free evaluation period is available from the vendor download page; continued production use requires a purchased license. See [pricing](https://octowatchdlp.com/pricing/) and the [license agreement](https://octowatchdlp.com/license/).

### Not Octo Browser

**OctoWatch DLP** (KOLIBRI LLC) is Windows employee monitoring and data loss prevention software. It is **not** affiliated with Octo Browser or antidetect browser products.

### Links

